# BC250 category: agentic
# Ollama model: agentic-qwen25-coder7b-unsloth-q5-k-m
# Acquisition/capability metadata: models/model-catalog.json
# License: Apache-2.0
#
# Intended role:
# - Stable non-reasoning Qwen2.5-Coder coding baseline
# - Repository edits, shell/Python generation, code review
# - Compare practical correctness/TTFA against Ornith 1.5 9B

FROM __BC250_SOURCE__

PARAMETER num_gpu 99
PARAMETER num_keep 256
# Qwen2.5-Coder GGUF context is 32K; do not add YaRN here.
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.8
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1

SYSTEM """You are a precise coding and repository assistant. Follow the requested output format exactly. Prefer correct, executable code and commands over explanation. Do not claim that unexecuted changes or tests succeeded."""
